        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>GoToTheSettingsForTransferringProductsBetweenOrganizations</name>
          <id>312</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Data will be rebuilt in accordance with &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>intercompany goods transfer settings&lt;/>. Therefore make sure in advance that all the settings are correct.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>داده‌ها طبق &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>تنظیمات انتقال کالای بین‌شرکتی&lt;/> بازسازی خواهند شد. بنابراین از قبل اطمینان حاصل کنید که همه تنظیمات صحیح هستند.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Переформирование будет происходить по &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>настройкам передачи товаров между организациями&lt;/>, поэтому рекомендуем предварительно убедиться, что все настройки указаны правильно.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Yeniden düzenleme, iş yerleri arası müşteri faturası için &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>ayarlarına göre gerçekleştirilecektir&lt;/>, bu nedenle öncelikle tüm ayarların doğru yapılandırıldığından emin olmanızı öneririz.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Thực hiện lập lại chứng từ theo &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>tùy chỉnh chuyển giao hàng hóa giữa các doanh nghiệp&lt;/>, do đó nên chắc chắn rằng đã thiết lập chính xác các tùy chỉnh.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Data will be rebuilt in accordance with &lt;link e1cib/command/message register.Setting up the transmission of goods between organizations.Team.Open the subscription form>intercompany goods transfer settings&lt;/>. Therefore make sure in advance that all the settings are correct.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
