                <value>Note:
— Detected errors generated by the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; documents must be corrected by the &quot;Stock surplus recognition&quot; documents (Wizard steps 2 and 6).
— When the detailed balance of company goods is corrected automatically, generated document lines that match the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; documents must be deleted manually.</value>
